{"title":"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/f/6df6ef753171a59eced4741b98b1ce817c397918.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1998-998}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/5/4b5fe6b62ce04f48d843c61e34ddc56005faa99c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\  1\\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 1000\\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 0.1\\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 10\\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 0.001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"467\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/c/8ac8fcc32be3a59b3a8f9f612465ee89e62f00d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1998-998}{1000} = \\frac{1000}{1000} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"237\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/8/e28b660816eec694768a12ed7b0bc772d49a5aa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1998-998}{1000} = \\frac{1998}{1000} - \\frac{998}{1000} = 1.998 - 0.998 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"428\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel